      "content": "look, i get the legal risk but you're thinking like a lawyer, not a PR specialist. if we say \"we are investigating the scope,\" the media will interpret that as \"we know something bad happened and we're hiding how bad it is.\" that's what triggers the panic. \n\ni need you to manage this. if we frame it correctly, we can contain this before it becomes a crisis. we need to project absolute confidence in our security. can you rewrite it to be much more forceful about the data being untouched? just make it look like we have everything under control so the markets stay calm. please.",
